# No /tmp on the proxy VPS

The Telegram gateway runs on `root@45.148.60.90`. Never write to `/tmp` on that host: not secrets, not logs, not packages, not audio, not env files, not scratch copies.

Use `/var/lib/telegram-gateway` (audio and Python tempfile: `/var/lib/telegram-gateway/tmp`). Set `TMPDIR` / `TEMP_DIR` there for anything that would otherwise use `/tmp`.
